      "content": "it’s hard to hear that though. i just feel like a weight on everyone. my partner is working so hard to make ends meet and i'm just... dead weight. everything they do is to fix the mess i made. i feel like if i weren't here, things might actually be easier for them. like they could finally breathe.",
